params:query {
  limit: 50
  ~before: 
}

params:path {
  roomId: 
}

docs {
  ### Get Messages
  Fetches the message history of a chat room.
  Supports cursor-based pagination using the `before` query parameter (an ISO-8601 timestamp string).
  
  #### Path Parameters
  - `roomId` (string, required): The UUID of the chat room.
  
  #### Query Parameters
  - `limit` (number, optional): Max number of messages to return. Defaults to `50`.
  - `before` (string, optional): Timestamp cursor to retrieve messages sent before a specific time.
  
  #### Response (200 OK)
  Returns messages in chronological order (oldest first) so they can be rendered directly into a chat window.
  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "data": [
      {
        "id": "msg-uuid",
        "room": "room-uuid",
        "content": "Hi there, I uploaded the requirements document.",
        "attachment_url": "https://cdn.gighub.ahsanull.com/user-id/general/1723456789-requirements.pdf",
        "attachment_name": "requirements.pdf",
        "attachment_type": "application/pdf",
        "created_at": "timestamp",
        "sender": {
          "id": "sender-uuid",
          "name": "Sender Name",
          "username": "sender",
          "email": "sender@example.com",
          "avatar": "url",
          "verified": true
        }
      }
    ],
    "message": "Messages retrieved successfully"
  }
  ```
}
